Description: OpenSesame plugin for sending triggers through the parallel port
 This plugin for the OpenSesame experiment builder sends
 stimulus synchronization triggers (0-255) through the parallel
 port to data acquisition systems, for example for EEG. On Linux
 it uses pyparallel (/dev/parportX).
